  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names the sovereign immortal aperture’s layers after the five regions and nine heavens with the word mini in front, including Mini Eastern Sea.",
      "chapters": [
        1066
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Early on it is not as vast as the outside Eastern Sea, and the deepest sea level is only sixty feet.",
      "chapters": [
        1099
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He places dragonfish there among other aquatic resources, and later builds artificial lakes that hold dragonfish, air bubble fish, literature carp, and further stock from Eastern Sea gains.",
      "chapters": [
        1066
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reverse Flow River is temporarily placed in Mini Eastern Sea.",
      "chapters": [
        1291
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_reverse_flow_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan annexes large numbers of water path immortal apertures, Mini Eastern Sea is no longer only shallow pools and lakes. It becomes a boundless aquatic expanse of raging waves, though the water level is still not deep. The first special sea area, dragon scale sea area, completely forms there. A Perseverance-modified bountiful year effect covers only a portion of Mini Eastern Sea.",
      "chapters": [
        1313
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "boundless-aquatic-expanse",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan plans to place green light shine fungi into Mini Eastern Sea while focusing most light-fungus work on the mini heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        1458
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fungi-placement-plan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The three hairy man continents are placed in Mini Eastern Sea. Fang Yuan also collects leftover refinement water into an incomplete Refinement Sea at the most western side of Mini Eastern Sea, close to Mini Central Continent.",
      "chapters": [
        1764
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fungi-placement-plan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_refinement_sea",
        "loc_mini_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Development adds water vein nodes such as divine rift whirlpool, seven treasures sea spring, underwater thousand year profound ice island, cleansing water region, and rolling pearl water treasury, with more than ten nodes gained in a short stretch and only three more needed to form one water vein ring. Compared with the other four mini regions, Mini Eastern Sea then has hairy men on the three major continents but remains too empty of other variant humans elsewhere, so merfolk relocation is discussed.",
      "chapters": [
        2229
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "water-vein-nodes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The dragon scale sea area in Mini Eastern Sea flows in reverse, sending seawater into the mini nine heavens, and the mission is to fix the immortal formation and rebuild that sea area.",
      "chapters": [
        2242
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sea-area-repair-and-inspection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "An inspection party comes to Mini Eastern Sea and looks at the sea area below when settling further inhabitants.",
      "chapters": [
        2243
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sea-area-repair-and-inspection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
